WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:01.835
- Sure, we wanna go to
all the touristy things,

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.260
but we can't look like tourists.

00:00:08.628 --> 00:00:10.253
I gotta pack in outfits, you know?

00:00:10.253 --> 00:00:11.762
What if we get invited to some VIP event?

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:13.388
You think we'll go on a
picnic while we're there?

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:15.013
- I like that shirt
but you always complain

00:00:15.013 --> 00:00:16.720
that you look like a carpenter in it.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.088
- I'm nervous, you know
I have a fear of flying.

00:00:19.088 --> 00:00:20.736
- Chris, do you wanna hold my hand?

00:00:22.629 --> 00:00:24.231
- My travel lotion and
my travel deodorant,

00:00:24.231 --> 00:00:26.217
and my travel razor...

00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:27.529
Where's my Purell?

00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:28.608
- Oh, I have Purell.

00:00:28.608 --> 00:00:29.816
- No, my travel Purell.

00:00:29.816 --> 00:00:31.026
Purell?

00:00:31.026 --> 00:00:31.761
- Yeah.

00:00:31.761 --> 00:00:33.064
Do you have any Purell?

00:00:33.064 --> 00:00:34.448
- I need some more Purell.

00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:35.435
- If you keep taking selfies

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.536
we're not gonna get to
the airport on time.

00:00:39.843 --> 00:00:40.627
Delete that.

00:00:40.627 --> 00:00:41.666
I look awful.

00:00:42.836 --> 00:00:44.670
Chris, you've got to roll everything

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.913
if you want it all to fit.

00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:46.841
- Should I bring a second suitcase

00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:48.002
in case we go shopping?

00:00:48.002 --> 00:00:50.139
- Chris, you're $4,000 in debt.

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:55.350
But I mean, if we see
something you have to have!

00:00:57.174 --> 00:00:58.138
- We have to get a tie,

00:00:58.138 --> 00:00:59.427
we're on vacation.

00:00:59.427 --> 00:01:00.646
- Okay, one tie.

00:01:00.646 --> 00:01:01.679
One tie.

00:01:01.679 --> 00:01:02.515
- Oh my God, what if we, like,

00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:04.059
both fall in love while we're there.

00:01:04.059 --> 00:01:05.568
What if we just moved into that apartment,

00:01:05.568 --> 00:01:07.310
like, found some wives.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.134
- Rich wives.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:09.736
Look at how fat he is!

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.234
- I told you I want a pug.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:12.023
I don't think I have enough room

00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:13.022
for a blow dryer.

00:01:13.022 --> 00:01:14.276
- Chris, be heavier.

00:01:14.276 --> 00:01:15.994
At least this is proof you're not fat.

00:01:16.932 --> 00:01:17.782
Right?

00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:19.616
- That's the nicest thing
you could have said to me.

00:01:19.616 --> 00:01:20.986
It's usually freezing there.

00:01:20.986 --> 00:01:22.623
- Well, everywhere is freezing.

00:01:22.623 --> 00:01:24.527
I said that you aren't fat.

00:01:24.527 --> 00:01:26.037
- I know, you said it,

00:01:26.037 --> 00:01:27.836
but you made me think about it.

00:01:27.836 --> 00:01:28.707
(sighs)

00:01:28.707 --> 00:01:30.298
I think I'm just in a
sensitive place right now.

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:32.132
- Oh my God, this place is perfect.

00:01:32.132 --> 00:01:33.386
- Airplanes make me feel gross,

00:01:33.386 --> 00:01:35.464
I need to take a shower
and do my hair immediately.

00:01:35.464 --> 00:01:37.623
- [Keith] There are so many pillows.

00:01:37.623 --> 00:01:38.970
- I'm gonna bring both of these.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:39.814
- Chris!

